msgid "Save keeps the selected listening side for future matches; Cancel preserves the previous setting. The match continues while the settings window is open. A defence already armed for the current ball remains active, but a new opponent hit requires a new playfield press. Dialog keys do not arm or change a defence. Close the window to return to the playfield controls."
